  "onboardingPage2Body": "Paint away what the AI missed or restore what you want to keep. Then crop, rotate, move and resize.",
  "onboardingPage3Title": "Studio-ready backgrounds",
  "onboardingPage3Body": "Choose a colour, gradient, template or your own photo, with a natural shadow. Marketplace presets for Amazon, eBay, Etsy and Shopify set size and format for you.",
  "onboardingPage4Title": "Batch it, export it, keep it private",
  "onboardingPage4Body": "Cut out up to 30 photos at once and export as PNG, JPG or WEBP. Your photos never leave your phone. Available in 43 languages.",
